    "updated_at": "2023-09-01T13:37:03Z",
    "body": "The same symmetry argument can also be made about [`remove()`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#dom-select-remove), which likewise only exists on `HTMLSelectElement`, but would make sense on the other two as well. ",
