    "created_at": "2023-09-01T14:18:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-01T14:18:43Z",
    "body": "I think that's right. We don't need symmetry for DOM Level 0 APIs. If libraries or Stack Overflow questions demonstrate that a particular API is lacking in some quantifiable manner we should strongly consider doing something about it, but absent that it's not worth it in my opinion.",
