    "updated_at": "2023-09-01T14:31:26Z",
    "body": "Sounds good to me. To be honest, I didn't even know about `add()` and `remove()` in the `select` context before this bug came up. I always just use `append()` or `appendChild()` (and `remove()` or `removeChild()`). Closing the issue. Thanks all!",
